      866      view-as alert-box question buttons yes-no update glog.
      867      if glog = no then return error.
      868                    else assign varupd-obj-date = yes.
      869   end.
      870   define variable vardata-valid as logical no-undo.
      871   define variable varmessage    as character no-undo.
      872   run integerm in this-procedure (
      873       input  s-name,
      874       input  no,
      875       input  no,
      876       output s-name-int,
      877       output vardata-valid,
      878       output varmessage ) no-error.
